WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.735
-Every night on our show,
I deliver a monologue

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:05.705
comprised of jokes written by
a diverse team of writers.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:08.174
As a result, a lot of jokes
come across my desk that,

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.642
due to my being
a straight, white male

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.378
would be difficult for me
to deliver.

00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:14.614
But we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.249
so we'd like to share them
with you now in a segment called

00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:19.519
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:23.223 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:26.392
These are two of our writers,
Amber and Jenny.

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:27.793
-I'm black.

00:00:27.793 --> 00:00:29.194
-And I'm gay.

00:00:29.194 --> 00:00:30.930
-And we're both women.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.698
-And I'm not.

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:34.067
So, here's how it works.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:35.534
I'll read the setups
to these jokes,

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.637
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.972
Here we go.

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.542
Clothing store J. Crew
announced recently

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.510
they will file for bankruptcy.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:48.147
-Said lesbians,
"We did our part."

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.349
-Well, you still have
L.L. Bean.

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:52.652
-True.
Fun fact about L.L. Bean --

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:56.422
the "L.L." stands for
lesbian, lesbian.

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:58.390
-Oh, I had no idea.

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:01.026
Activists recently painted
"Black Lives Matter"

00:01:01.026 --> 00:01:03.629
on Fifth Avenue
outside of Trump Tower.

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:06.165
-And because it was in
the middle of Fifth Avenue,

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:08.367
Trump shot it.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:10.469
-Amber, do you think
Trump was mad

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.271
when he saw that
written on the street?

00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:13.439
-No.

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:14.941
He doesn't know how to read.

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:17.443
He thinks it says
"Blake Lively matters."

00:01:17.443 --> 00:01:18.812
And he loves it.

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.246
-Yeah.

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:24.583
A lesbian couple recently both
gave birth three days apart.

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:26.819
-And only two weeks
after meeting each other

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:28.288
and moving in together.

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:29.955
-So, Jenny,
you make a lot of jokes

00:01:29.955 --> 00:01:31.991
about how lesbians
move in together quickly.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.259
Do you do that?

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:35.928
-Oh, no, I always wait
until the third date.

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:38.397
-Aw, that's very patient.

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:40.233
Researchers at
Stanford University

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.801
are working on a smart toilet

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:44.404
that can identify
the user's butt.

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:47.540
-So, expect an error message,
white women!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.710
[ Robotic voice ] "Warning!
Warning! No butt detected!"

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:51.978
-Wait.

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:54.714
The toilet seat has arms, Amber?

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:56.315
-[ Normal voice ]
It gets up and walks to you

00:01:56.315 --> 00:01:57.550
when you have to poop.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.251
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.251 --> 00:02:01.187
-To prevent the spread of
the coronavirus,

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:03.055
health experts are recommending
that people

00:02:03.055 --> 00:02:05.391
keep their fingernails short.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:08.460
-"Way ahead of you,"
said lesbians.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.764
-Jenny, do you want to explain
that joke to viewers?

00:02:11.764 --> 00:02:13.466
-Nah, they'll finger it out.

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:15.935
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:18.004
I just fingered it out.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:21.374
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:24.477
Aunt Jemima pancake mix
will be given a new logo

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:28.113
because the original was
based on black stereotypes.

00:02:28.113 --> 00:02:30.216
-"I still like the one about us

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.552
having big [bleep], though,"
said Uncle Ben.

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:35.121
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:38.491
Oh, I got to start looking at
these ahead of time.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:39.558
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.558 --> 00:02:41.995
-We're too unsupervised.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:45.297
-According to a new
Congressional report,

00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:47.900
women should be eligible
for the draft.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:52.305
-Said the military, "Well, we
would save a lot on payroll."

00:02:52.305 --> 00:02:55.007
-Last month, Mississippi
retired their state flag,

00:02:55.007 --> 00:02:57.744
which included the image of
a Confederate symbol.

00:02:57.744 --> 00:03:00.146
-But they replaced it
with the image

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:03.315
of a black person
being denied a loan.

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:06.319
-Hey, Seth, why don't you
tell one?

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:08.454
-Oh, guys, I really don't think
I should.

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.522
-Oh, come on, just one.

00:03:10.522 --> 00:03:13.092
-No. I feel like if I do it,
it won't end well.

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.393
-Do it!
-Do it!

00:03:14.393 --> 00:03:16.229
-Come on.
-Alright, fine.

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:17.596
Because I trust and believe
you guys

00:03:17.596 --> 00:03:19.298
and you wouldn't lie to me
during a pandemic.

00:03:19.298 --> 00:03:23.736
According to a new report, sales
of bras dropped last month.

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:26.806
Also dropping -- boobs.

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:29.408
-How dare you!

00:03:29.408 --> 00:03:32.778
-You both told me
it would be okay!

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:34.780
-You should be ashamed
of yourself.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:38.918
-Black women and lesbians
are liars!

